D|Right. Their contract ends on the thirtieth of November, and they have asked for a two year term instead of one.
S|That works if they accept the new pricing. What did their finance team say about the four percent increase?
D|They pushed back a little, but I think three and a half percent with a two year term is acceptable to them.
S|Okay. Let's offer three and a half percent, two years, and keep the current service levels.
D|Agreed. I will draft the renewal proposal and send it to Maria for review by Thursday.
